guide forever/class/priest/hex-of-weakness-and-shadowguard
title Hex of Weakness and Shadowguard
category Class
class Priest
folder Priest
faction Horde
race Troll
levels 10-20
zone Orgrimmar
keywords Hex of Weakness, Shadowguard, Ur'kyo, Tai'jin, Var'jun, Miles Welsh, Aelthalyste, Valley of Spirits, Troll, racial, Priest
reward spell 9035 "Hex of Weakness"
reward spell 18137 "Shadowguard"
why The Troll priest spells: Hex of Weakness at 10, Shadowguard at 20. Free, no objectives.

# The Troll Priest spell quests. Each spell has one quest at the teacher,
# Ur'kyo (Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar), and letters from priest trainers in
# other towns; any one teaches the spell and the game offers only one of a
# set:
#   Hex of Weakness (level 10):
#     5652 Ur'kyo (Orgrimmar), his own quest
#     5654 Tai'jin (Razor Hill, Durotar)
#     5655 Var'jun (by Bloodhoof Village, Mulgore)
#     5656 Miles Welsh (Spirit Rise, Thunder Bluff)
#     5657 Aelthalyste (Undercity)
#   Shadowguard (level 20):
#     5680 Ur'kyo (Orgrimmar), his own quest
#     5642 Miles Welsh (Thunder Bluff)
#     5643 Aelthalyste (Undercity)
# The guide sends you to the giver in the zone you stand in when it gets
# there (`when zone`), else straight to Ur'kyo; a letter you carry from
# anywhere is handed in on its own step (`when onquest`). Pickups are `talk`
# goals, not accepts: one guide accepting two quests of one exclusive set
# warns in lint, which does not follow `when`.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for the givers; Forever's quest pages
# (snapshot) agree, except that 5656's page names no giver (the reference
# data has Miles Welsh); Forever's Priest class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): all unchanged, both stay Troll spells (Hex of
# Weakness now lowers melee attack power instead of damage dealt).
# Var'jun stands just south-west of Bloodhoof Village (npcs.json, Mulgore
# 46.2,62.3 on the live map).
# horde/orc-troll/01-durotar carries Hex of Weakness 5654 on the route (to
# Ur'kyo at about 16) and horde/04-the-barrens Shadowguard 5642.
# Based on data, not play: written from the sources above.

step Hex of Weakness: Tai'jin
  when zone "Durotar"
  when !onquest 5652,5654,5655,5656,5657
  zone Durotar
  tip At 10, Tai'jin, the priest trainer inside the barracks of Razor Hill (the first building on the right as you come up the road from the Valley of Trials), hands you a Hex of Weakness letter for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar. Razor Hill is on the road north to the city.
  level 10
  talk 3706                                   -- Tai'jin: take his Hex of Weakness letter

step Hex of Weakness: Var'jun
  when zone "Mulgore"
  when !onquest 5652,5654,5655,5656,5657
  zone Mulgore
  tip At 10 in Mulgore, Var'jun, just south-west of Bloodhoof Village, hands you a Hex of Weakness letter for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar.
  level 10
  talk 11407                                  -- Var'jun: take the Hex of Weakness letter

step Hex of Weakness: Miles Welsh
  when zone "Thunder Bluff"
  when !onquest 5652,5654,5655,5656,5657
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 10 in Thunder Bluff, Miles Welsh, the priest trainer in the cave under Spirit Rise, hands you a Hex of Weakness letter for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar.
  level 10
  talk 3044                                   -- Miles Welsh: take his Hex of Weakness letter

step Hex of Weakness: Aelthalyste
  when zone "Undercity"
  when !onquest 5652,5654,5655,5656,5657
  zone Undercity
  tip At 10 in the Undercity, Aelthalyste, the priest trainer in the War Quarter, hands you a Hex of Weakness letter for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar (the zeppelin from the tower outside the Undercity).
  level 10
  talk 4606                                   -- Aelthalyste: take her Hex of Weakness letter

step Hex of Weakness: Ur'kyo
  when !onquest 5652,5654,5655,5656,5657
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 10, go to Ur'kyo, the priest trainer in a hut in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar's south-west corner: he gives Hex of Weakness and takes it back at once. No letter needed.
  level 10
  accept 5652                                 -- Ur'kyo
  turnin 5652                                 -- Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness

step Hex of Weakness: Tai'jin's letter
  when onquest 5654
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Follow the road north from Razor Hill into Orgrimmar and west to the Valley of Spirits: Ur'kyo takes the letter and teaches Hex of Weakness.
  turnin 5654                                 -- Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness

step Hex of Weakness: Var'jun's letter
  when onquest 5655
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Hand the letter to Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar (from Mulgore: north through the Barrens and east into Durotar, or fly from Thunder Bluff once you know Orgrimmar's flight path).
  turnin 5655                                 -- Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness

step Hex of Weakness: Miles Welsh's letter
  when onquest 5656
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Hand the letter to Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar (from Mulgore: north through the Barrens and east into Durotar, or fly from Thunder Bluff once you know Orgrimmar's flight path).
  turnin 5656                                 -- Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness

step Hex of Weakness: Aelthalyste's letter
  when onquest 5657
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Hand the letter to Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar (the zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades lands outside Orgrimmar).
  turnin 5657                                 -- Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness

step Shadowguard: Miles Welsh
  when zone "Thunder Bluff"
  when !onquest 5680,5642,5643
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 20 in Thunder Bluff, Miles Welsh in the cave under Spirit Rise hands you a Shadowguard letter for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar.
  level 20
  talk 3044                                   -- Miles Welsh: take his Shadowguard letter

step Shadowguard: Aelthalyste
  when zone "Undercity"
  when !onquest 5680,5642,5643
  zone Undercity
  tip At 20 in the Undercity, Aelthalyste in the War Quarter hands you a Shadowguard letter for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar.
  level 20
  talk 4606                                   -- Aelthalyste: take her Shadowguard letter

step Shadowguard: Ur'kyo
  when !onquest 5680,5642,5643
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 20, Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits teaches Shadowguard with a quest he gives and takes back at once.
  level 20
  accept 5680                                 -- Ur'kyo
  turnin 5680                                 -- Ur'kyo: Shadowguard

step Shadowguard: Miles Welsh's letter
  when onquest 5642
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Hand the letter to Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar (from Mulgore: north through the Barrens and east into Durotar, or fly from Thunder Bluff once you know Orgrimmar's flight path).
  turnin 5642                                 -- Ur'kyo: Shadowguard

step Shadowguard: Aelthalyste's letter
  when onquest 5643
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Hand the letter to Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits, Orgrimmar (the zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades lands outside Orgrimmar).
  turnin 5643                                 -- Ur'kyo: Shadowguard
